OL,3,GNEWSAMan jailed for city centre subway
OL,4,Ashooting
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man has been jailed for 12 years
OL,7,Fafter he shot another man in the leg in
OL,8,Fa subway in Wolverhampton.
OL,10,FEmergency services were called to
OL,11,Freports of a shooting near the subway
OL,12,Funderpass on Peel Street,
OL,13,FWolverhampton, at about 15:30 BST on 12
OL,14,FOctober.
OL,16,FA 20-year-old man was taken to hospital
OL,17,Fwith serious leg injuries and
OL,18,F"thankfully survived", West Midlands
OL,19,FPolice said.
OL,23,APub: 16-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
