OL,3,GNEWSAMan jailed for city centre subway
OL,4,Ashooting
OL,5,
OL,6,FFollowing an investigation, Tyriq
OL,7,FBingham, 22, of Tangmere Road,
OL,8,FWolverhampton, pleaded guilty to
OL,9,Fwounding with intent and possession of
OL,10,Fa firearm with intent to endanger life.
